OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod delves into the
OL,6,     Gearly life of the great German
OL,7,     Gcomposer Heinrich Schutz, when
OL,8,     Gthe boy's musical talents were
OL,9,     Gdiscovered by an aristocrat.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham welcomes the
OL,12,     GSitkovetsky Trio in studio for a
OL,13,     Glive performance, and live music
OL,14,     Gfrom jazz singers Emma Smith and
OL,15,     GNatalie Williams.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
