OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,6,     GWales and Principal Conductor
OL,7,     GRyan Bancroft perform Mahler, and
OL,8,     Gare joined by Johan Dalene in
OL,9,     GBrahms' Violin Concerto.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Vivaldi in a Warming
OL,11,     FWorld
OL,12,     GKate Molleson talks with Magnus
OL,13,     GLindberg, who takes us back to
OL,14,     Ghis 1985 piece Kraft , one of the
OL,15,     Ggreat sonic rumpuses of the late
OL,16,     G20th century.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
