OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GThe rising Belgian trombonist and
OL,6,     Gbandleader is giving out four
OL,7,     Gbouquets this week.
OL,8,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,9,     GYunchan Lim makes his Proms debut
OL,10,     Gwith the BBC Symphony Orchestra,
OL,11,     Gperforming Beethoven's 'Emperor'
OL,12,     Gconcerto. Bookending the Prom are
OL,13,     GBruckner's First Symphony and
OL,14,     GTuur's Aditus.
